msgid "Signed URL lifetime"
msgstr ""

#: assets/build/app.1.0.0.js:6
msgid "A signed URL is created at the moment of the click, after the access check, and is never printed into a page. The signature is checked when the download starts, so a long download that starts in time still finishes."
msgstr ""

